Notes:
- The JSON Schema used is {"type": "object", "required": [...keys...]}. The "required" keyword requires string property names per JSON Schema; keys will be converted to strings.
- The function attempts to call common jsonschem entry points (validate functions or validator classes). If none of the expected APIs exist or calls fail in unexpected ways, it falls back to a pure-Python containment check.

